<title>ITALY: Bank Italy seen checking mark/lira prices at 996.</title>
<headline>Bank Italy seen checking mark/lira prices at 996.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy was checking mark/lira prices on the foreign exchanges at around 996 lire per mark, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bank of Italy was asking prices around 996 but it didn't deal,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bank of Italy is watching and continuing to check the market,&quot; another said.</p>
<p>The lira was quoted at 995.70/5.90 per mark by 1525 GMT with a day's low of 996.20.</p>
</text>
